.TH MACORA 1 "October 2026" "macora 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
macora \- explainable network cockpit for macOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B macora
[\fIINTERFACE\fR | \fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIWORDS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows grouped, explained network interfaces and read-only diagnostics. Nothing changes system settings unless
.B set
is run with
.BR \-\-apply .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B show
Grouped interfaces (default).
.TP
.B explain \fIIFACE\fR
Explain flags, IPv6 and interface role.
.TP
.B diagnose
Walk link, router, internet, sign-in page, DNS, HTTPS, path MTU, Wi-Fi and IPv6 and print a verdict with what to try. Sends a few packets. Words: \fBto\fR \fIHOST\fR (check a site), \fBquick\fR, \fBspeed\fR, \fBstrict\fR, \fBredact\fR, \fBmd\fR|\fBhtml\fR|\fBjson\fR, \fBcount\fR \fIN\fR \fBinterval\fR \fIS\fR. See docs/DIAGNOSE.md.
.TP
.B ping \fIHOST\fR, trace \fIHOST\fR
Packet loss/latency and hop path.
.TP
.B doctor, topology, report, routes, path, dns, services, wifi, neighbors, sockets
Local inspection views.
.TP
.B watch
Live counters and rates; add \fBprometheus\fR for scrape-ready text.
.TP
.B snapshot \fIFILE\fR, diff \fIA\fR \fIB\fR
Save (mode 0600, never overwrite) and compare captures.
.TP
.B tui, interactive
Full-screen dashboard and REPL.
.TP
.B completions \fISHELL\fR
Print bash, zsh or fish completions.
.SH WORDS
Options are plain words after a command or interface, as in
.BR "macora en0 raw" .
.TP
.B all
Include tunnels, Apple system links and loopback.
.TP
.B up, down
Only interfaces that are up, or down.
.TP
.B list
Interface names only, in system order, like \fBifconfig -l\fR.
.TP
.B raw
The original ifconfig text for the selected interfaces.
.TP
.B json, redact, compact, ipv4, ipv6
Machine-readable output; mask IP and MAC values; less detail; one address family.
.TP
.B html, md, prometheus
Output format for report, show and watch.
.TP
.B from \fIFILE\fR
Inspect a saved ifconfig capture offline.
.TP
.B interface \fINAME\fR, group \fINAME\fR
Select an interface or group.
.TP
.B count \fIN\fR, interval \fISECONDS\fR, timeout \fIMS\fR
Watch frames, watch interval, probe timeout.
.TP
.B theme \fINAME\fR, color \fIMODE\fR
TUI palette (default, mono, high-contrast); auto, always or never.
.TP
.B apply
Execute a previewed change.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
macora
macora en0
macora en0 raw
macora list up
macora en0 mtu 1400          # preview only
macora diagnose
macora report html redact > report.html
macora watch count 5 json
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable color output.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 1 on error or when diagnose finds a failing layer.
